                    <p>7.2 Eligibility is subject to ongoing compliance with these Terms and applicable law.</p>
                    <p>7.3 If it is Your first time making a purchase with Us, whether it be a purchase of a Good or a Membership, You may receive entries into the Membership Giveaway that will be specified upon checkout.</p>
                    <p>7.4 If You have an Active Subscription to Our Membership or have made previous purchases that qualify You for an upcoming Membership Giveaway, and have provided Your email to receive communications from Us, We will send the details of the upcoming Membership Giveaway to Your registered email address.</p>
                    <p>7.5 All current Membership Giveaways, including prize details, total prize value, draw date, draw location, notification process, prize claim period and any redraw arrangements, are set out in the applicable Membership Giveaway Terms and Conditions available at: <a href="https://www.xhale.com.au/support-and-legal">https://www.xhale.com.au/support-and-legal</a>.</p>
                    <h4>Allocation of Entries</h4>
                    <p>7.6 Entry allocation operates as follows:</p>
                    <ol class="alpha-bracket">
                        <li><strong>Subscription Holders</strong>
                            <ol class="roman-bracket">
                                <li>Members holding an Active Subscription receive recurring Subscription Entries as specified at the time of Subscription;</li>
                                <li>Subscription Entries may be used for Major Giveaways and Minor Giveaways; and</li>
                                <li>Subscription Entries continue to accrue while the Subscription remains active.</li>
                            </ol>
                        </li>
                        <li><strong>Package Holders</strong>
                            <ol class="roman-bracket">
                                <li>Members who purchase a Package receive the number of Package Entries allocated to that Package;</li>
                                <li>Package Entries may only be used for entry into the specific Major Giveaway selected and identified at the time of checkout and cannot be applied to any other promotion; and</li>
                                <li>Package Entries are non-transferable, non-refundable, and must be used in accordance with these Terms and Conditions.</li>
                            </ol>
                        </li>
                        <li><strong>Entry Period and Accumulation</strong>
                            <ol class="roman-bracket">
                                <li>For Members with an active Subscription, entries accrue on a recurring basis in accordance with the applicable Subscription, and will continue to accumulate from week to week while the Subscription remains active;</li>
                                <li>Entries accrued under an active Subscription will carry forward into subsequent Major Giveaways and Minor Giveaways unless and until they are reset in accordance with these Terms and Conditions;</li>
