                                <li>Entries will only reset in accordance with clause 7.6(d).</li>
                            </ol>
                        </li>
                        <li><strong>Reset of Entries</strong>
                            <ol class="roman-bracket">
                                <li>Entries accrued by a Member will reset to zero only if:
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>the Member wins a Major Giveaway, in which case all entries accrued under an Active Subscription and any Package Entries then held by that Member will reset to zero; or</li>
                                        <li>in respect of any Package Entries allocated under a Package, the relevant Major Giveaway for which those Package Entries were valid has been drawn.</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </li>
                            </ol>
                        </li>
