                    <p>7.10 Winners of Membership Giveaways are determined by a random draw conducted using a method that ensures each valid entry has an equal chance of winning and independently witnessed where required by applicable law. Draws will take place on the dates, at the times and at the locations specified in the applicable Membership Giveaway Terms and Conditions.</p>
                    <p>7.11 Winners will be notified in writing using the contact details associated with their Membership Account within a reasonable time after the draw. Where required by law, winners' first initial, surname and State or Territory of residence will be published on Our Website for the period required under applicable law.</p>
