                    <h4>Free Alternative Method of Entry</h4>
                    <p>7.17 An individual who is eighteen (18) years or older, is an Australian resident and is not an Excluded Member may obtain one (1) entry into a Major Giveaway without purchasing a Subscription or Package by submitting a written request in the manner specified in the applicable Membership Giveaway Terms and Conditions during the Entry Period.</p>
