                    </ol>
                    <p>7.19 Only one (1) free entry is permitted per eligible individual per Major Giveaway. Multiple requests, automated requests, or requests submitted on behalf of another person will be invalid.</p>
                    <p>7.20 A free entry constitutes a single standard entry and does not confer any entitlement to Subscription benefits, entry accumulation, bonus entries or participation in Minor Giveaways.</p>
                    <p>7.21 Free entries are subject to the same eligibility requirements, draw process and prize conditions as all other valid entries.</p>
                    <h4>Regulatory Compliance</h4>
